 ---
 
+## 3b. Start-here links per video type (v7.0.109)
+
+These are real pages, checked when this version shipped: open the page, download the MP3, and drop it into
+`music_library/`. The credit obligation is stated on each line - nothing here needs a subscription.
+
+| Video type | Start here | Credit? | Why this one |
+|---|---|---|---|
+| **Education / explainer** | [Mixkit · Inspirational](https://mixkit.co/free-stock-music/tag/inspirational/) | No | Free, no account, no cap; clean beds that stay behind a voice. |
+| | [YouTube Audio Library](https://studio.youtube.com/channel/UC/video_manager/music) | Filter "Attribution not required" | The only library YouTube itself treats as copyright-safe. |
+| | [Scott Buckley · Amberlight](https://www.scottbuckley.com.au/library/amberlight/) | Yes - CC BY 4.0 | Warmer, more cinematic than stock; paste the exact credit. |
+| **Motivation** | [Scott Buckley library](https://www.scottbuckley.com.au/library/) | Yes - CC BY 4.0 | Built for slow builds and payoffs. |
+| | [Pixabay · inspiring](https://pixabay.com/music/search/inspiring/) | No | Huge, no credit; avoid tracks with the Content ID shield. |
+| **Documentary / story** | [Scott Buckley · Discovery](https://www.scottbuckley.com.au/library/discovery/) | Yes - CC BY 4.0 | The reference sound for narrated documentary. |
+| | [Mixkit · Cinematic](https://mixkit.co/free-stock-music/tag/cinematic/) | No | Fewer tracks, zero obligations. |
+| **Technology / AI** | [Mixkit · Technology](https://mixkit.co/free-stock-music/tag/technology/) | No | Quickest usable synth bed. |
+| | [Uppbeat · Electronic](https://uppbeat.io/music/genre/electronic) | Yes - Uppbeat Credit code per video | Modern, consistent; ~3 free downloads a month. |
+| **Kids** | [Pixabay · kids](https://pixabay.com/music/search/kids/) | No | Playful and simple; check the shield icon. |
+| | [YouTube Audio Library](https://studio.youtube.com/channel/UC/video_manager/music) | Usually no | Mood "Happy", filter attribution-free. |
+| **Travel / lifestyle** | [Mixkit · Travel](https://mixkit.co/free-stock-music/tag/travel/) | No | Open, rhythmic, no account. |
+| | [Pixabay · travel](https://pixabay.com/music/search/travel/) | No | Wider catalogue when Mixkit is too "stock". |
+| **Business / finance** | [Mixkit · Corporate](https://mixkit.co/free-stock-music/tag/corporate/) | No | The standard corporate bed. |
+| | [Bensound · Corporate](https://www.bensound.com/royalty-free-music/tag/corporate) | Yes - 3-line credit + code | Polished; free tier is per-video. |
+
+Print the same table in the terminal:
+
+```bash
+python3 cli.py v3 music-suggest --content-type education --playbook
+python3 cli.py v3 music-suggest --playbook          # all seven types
+```
+
+### What each licence actually obliges you to do
+
+| Library | Credit line | Content ID | Watch out for |
+|---|---|---|---|
+| **YouTube Audio Library** | Only for tracks marked "Attribution required" (CC BY) | Not claimed on YouTube | The guarantee is YouTube-only - no cover for TikTok/Instagram reuploads. |
+| **Mixkit** | None required | Not registered | The Free License excludes CDs/DVDs, video games and TV/radio broadcast; assets may not be resold as files. A few assets carry the Restricted (non-commercial) licence - check the track page. |
+| **Pixabay** | None required | Some tracks carry a Content ID shield | Do not resell tracks as files; keep the download page as proof. |
+| **Uppbeat** | Free tier: a unique Uppbeat Credit per download, **one video each**, in the description | Every track is registered | ~3 downloads a month on the free plan, part of the catalogue only, individual creators only. Paid plans safelist the channel and drop the per-video code. |
+| **Bensound** | Free tier: "Music by Bensound.com / License code: … / Artist: …" | The code is what clears a claim | A fresh code per video; the free tier does not cover podcasts, audiobooks, client work or paid ads. |
+| **Scott Buckley** | Required, exact text: `'Title' by Scott Buckley - released under CC-BY 4.0. www.scottbuckley.com.au` | Registered, with claim release tied to the credit | Miss the credit and you get a claim; paid licences (AUD 40/75/300) remove the obligation. |
+| **Free Music Archive** | Per track: CC0 = none, CC BY = required | Varies | Never use NC or ND tracks on a monetised channel. |
+| **Incompetech** | Required (CC BY 4.0) | Some tracks claimed | Copy the credit format printed on each track page. |
+| **Chosic** | Follows the source track's licence | Unknown | It is a directory, not a library: download from the original platform. |
+
+---
+
